  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Cherry MX style mechanical keyboard switch, Kailh/Gateron hot-swap socket and through-hole soldering, double-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square with R2.00 corner relief (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile). Keycap: 7.00u (courtyard 133.30x19.00mm). No stabilizer PCB features. Plate-mount MX stabilizers can be used.")
